{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G4-04","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區斜交路口，穿越與速限提示是否完整？","intro":"主要道路約 20 m、次要道路約 6 m，兩側無人行設施。","images":[{"key":"results:g4-04-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-04-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-04-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-04-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g4-04-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"pedestrian","title":"長距離穿越缺少庇護","text":"主要道路穿越距離長，路口未提供行人庇護島。"},{"id":"lanes","title":"主要道路車道銜接不一致","text":"路口進出車道數不同，行車動線需要清楚引導。"},{"id":"speed","title":"速限資訊不連續","text":"主要道路僅部分方向有速限提示，次要道路則缺少速限標示。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[89,90],"strategy":{"title":"平衡斜交車道，補足行人庇護","intro":"透過槽化與導引線整理轉向空間，並安排長距離穿越的中途停等位置。","images":[{"key":"results:g4-04-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"lanes","title":"調整車道與左轉等待空間","text":"以槽化線平衡進出車道數，並留出左轉專用車道空間。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"guidance","title":"引導次要道路穿越路口","text":"配合斜交幾何劃設路口行車導引線，讓通過路口的路徑容易判讀。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"walking","title":"提供行人中途庇護","text":"在較寬、車速較快的主要道路配置庇護島，銜接行穿線與人行空間。","moduleId":"M3-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-4-04-signalized-rural-skewed-cross.typ","sha256":"59f8a90fb90e07ca491c3636e42d0f2e1d87ebefff3abfebaadc48f6a66b2f16","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g4-04-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G4-04/G4-04_現況圖_01.png","width":2403,"height":2290,"label":"G4-04 現況圖","scenario":"G4-04","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":89,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image118.png","sha256":"b28275358445ad6f27fee6d44e9c34f622b5e534538b8c75f717067b7e1b5067"},"results:g4-04-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G4-04/G4-04_現況照片_01.png","width":2516,"height":1415,"label":"G4-04 現況照片","scenario":"G4-04","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":90,"sourcePart":"ppt/